WEBVTT

00:07.867 --> 00:09.133
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.200 --> 00:10.833
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.900 --> 00:12.300
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.367 --> 00:14.267
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.333 --> 00:17.300
- * Ohh... *
-*哦...*

00:17.367 --> 00:19.400
* Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:19.467 --> 00:21.400
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.467 --> 00:23.233
- * Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:23.300 --> 00:24.967
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.033 --> 00:27.233
- * If nautical nonsense
be something you wish *
- *如果航海废话
成为你所希望的*

00:27.300 --> 00:29.100
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.167 --> 00:31.367
- * Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish *
- * 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通 *

00:31.433 --> 00:33.400
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.467 --> 00:35.267
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.333 --> 00:37.400
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.467 --> 00:39.533
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.600 --> 00:40.867
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.933 --> 00:42.733
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.800 --> 00:45.467
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.533 --> 00:47.767
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

00:47.833 --> 00:49.433
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:51.833 --> 00:54.767
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:54.833 --> 01:01.600
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

01:01.667 --> 01:04.500
- Spot? Spot?
- 点？点？

01:04.567 --> 01:05.333
Spot?
点？

01:05.400 --> 01:07.100
Where are you, Spot?
斯波，你在哪里？

01:07.167 --> 01:09.200
[whistles]
[口哨声]

01:09.267 --> 01:12.400
Oh, there you are, boy!
Come to me.
哦，你来了，孩子！
到我这里来。

01:12.467 --> 01:15.267
Jump in my arms and give me
your precious kisses.
跳进我的怀里，给我
你珍贵的吻。

01:15.333 --> 01:18.100
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

01:18.167 --> 01:20.967
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

01:21.067 --> 01:22.300
Good amoeba.
好阿米巴。

01:22.367 --> 01:24.167
You get a num-num.
你得到一个 num-num。

01:24.233 --> 01:26.267
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

01:29.467 --> 01:31.667
- Plankton, have you
been feeding Spot
- 浮游生物，有你吗
一直在喂现货

01:31.733 --> 01:33.367
a lot of treats lately?
最近有很多好吃的吗？

01:33.433 --> 01:35.833
He's looking bigger than usual.
他看起来比平常更大。

01:35.900 --> 01:37.133
- Karen!
- 凯伦！

01:37.200 --> 01:39.067
Not in front of the amoeba.
不是在阿米巴原虫面前。

01:39.100 --> 01:41.233
Spot is fit as a fiddle.
斑点就像小提琴一样适合。

01:41.300 --> 01:42.767
- [burps]
- [打嗝]

01:42.833 --> 01:44.100
- All right, Doctor.
- 好吧，医生。

01:44.167 --> 01:45.767
If you say so.
如果你这么说的话。

01:45.833 --> 01:47.967
- Come on, I'll prove it.
- 来吧，我会证明这一点。

01:48.900 --> 01:54.700
Now you'll see how healthy
my little Spotty-wotty is.
现在你就会看到多么健康
我的小斑点沃蒂是。

01:54.767 --> 01:56.900
[overlapping barking]
[重叠的吠叫]

01:56.967 --> 01:57.967
[device beeping]
[设备蜂鸣声]

01:58.067 --> 01:59.867
Wha--pregnant?
什——怀孕了？

02:00.067 --> 02:01.900
Ah, that can't be right.
啊，那是不对的。

02:01.967 --> 02:03.400
I thought he was a boy.
我以为他是个男孩。

02:03.467 --> 02:05.567
- I'm not sure it matters
for amoebas.
- 我不确定这是否重要
对于阿米巴原虫。

02:05.633 --> 02:09.333
Food-rich environments
cause amoebas to reproduce,
食物丰富的环境
导致阿米巴原虫繁殖，

02:09.400 --> 02:11.067
and you've certainly provided
你肯定已经提供了

02:11.133 --> 02:13.400
a food-rich environment.
食物丰富的环境。

02:13.467 --> 02:15.200
- [whines]
- Who's gonna be a mama?
- [哀嚎]
- 谁要当妈妈？

02:15.267 --> 02:16.733
Good boy!
好孩子！

02:16.800 --> 02:19.300
- We're not ready
to have puppies, Karen!
- 我们还没准备好
养小狗，凯伦！

02:19.367 --> 02:22.067
This is all happening
a little too fast.
这一切正在发生
有点太快了。

02:22.133 --> 02:24.400
We have to set up a
state-of-the-art delivery room,
我们必须设立一个
最先进的产房，

02:24.467 --> 02:25.800
sanitize everything,
消毒一切，

02:25.867 --> 02:28.267
baby-proof the Chum Bucket--
wait.
婴儿防护的密友桶——
等等。

02:28.333 --> 02:29.433
Where's Spot?
现货在哪里？

02:29.500 --> 02:31.633
- [whining from other room]
- [来自其他房间的抱怨声]

02:31.700 --> 02:33.400
- What the...
- 什么...

02:34.567 --> 02:35.533
Puppies?
小狗？

02:35.600 --> 02:37.567
- [barks]
- You did it, boy!
- [吠叫]
- 你做到了，孩子！

02:37.633 --> 02:40.867
Oh, I'm so glad you're okay.
哦，我很高兴你没事。

02:40.933 --> 02:42.300
Wait.
等待。

02:42.367 --> 02:44.267
Is that my good dinner jacket?
- [barks]
这是我的好晚礼服吗？
- [吠叫]

02:44.333 --> 02:46.933
- Oh, who cares
about a dinner jacket?
-哦，谁在乎呢
关于晚礼服？

02:47.067 --> 02:49.067
Aw, look at the little puppies!
噢，看看那些小小狗！

02:49.133 --> 02:50.967
- Yeesh.
Calm down, Karen.
- 是的。
冷静点，凯伦。

02:51.067 --> 02:53.067
You don't want to blow out
your motherboard.
你不想吹出去
你的主板。

02:53.067 --> 02:54.500
- Oh, I'm gonna name you Steven
- 哦，我会给你起名叫史蒂文

02:54.567 --> 02:56.367
and Karen and Clayton
and Vincent and--
以及凯伦和克莱顿
还有文森特和——

02:56.433 --> 02:58.167
cute overload.
可爱的超载。

02:58.233 --> 02:59.267
[whirring]
[呼呼]

02:59.333 --> 03:01.500
[electricity crackling]
[电力噼啪声]

03:01.567 --> 03:03.900
[power fading,
screen chimes]
[力量衰退，
屏幕铃声]

03:03.967 --> 03:07.300
- Oh, sure, you take a couple
of hours to reboot, Karen.
- 哦，当然，你带几个
重新启动需要几个小时，凯伦。

03:07.367 --> 03:08.567
It's fine.
没关系。

03:08.633 --> 03:10.133
I'll just manage
all these puppies
我只会应付
所有这些小狗

03:10.200 --> 03:11.133
all on my own!
一切都靠我自己！

03:11.200 --> 03:14.433
[puppies barking]
[小狗吠叫]

03:16.200 --> 03:19.200
[stool shattering]
- Hey! Get down from there!
[凳子碎裂]
- 嘿！从那里下来！

03:19.267 --> 03:21.500
Stop that!
My furniture!
别这样！
我的家具！

03:21.567 --> 03:24.467
[shattering, hissing]
[破碎，嘶嘶声]

03:24.533 --> 03:26.167
My experiments!
我的实验！

03:26.233 --> 03:27.900
Bad amoebas! Bad!
- [barking]
坏阿米巴原虫！坏的！
- [吠叫]

03:27.967 --> 03:29.333
- I don't get it, Karen.
- 我不明白，凯伦。

03:29.400 --> 03:30.800
Spot is so well behaved,
Spot表现得这么好，

03:30.867 --> 03:33.633
but the puppies don't listen
to me at all.
但小狗不听
对我来说根本。

03:33.700 --> 03:35.133
I think we need to
get rid of them.
我认为我们需要
摆脱他们。

03:35.200 --> 03:36.533
- [whirring]
- [呼呼]

03:36.600 --> 03:38.533
- Yeah, I know what you
would say.
- 是的，我知道你在做什么
会说。

03:38.600 --> 03:41.267
"Don't you vaporize
those puppies, Plankton."
“你别蒸发了
那些小狗，浮游生物。”

03:41.333 --> 03:44.133
- [whirring]
- [呼呼]

03:44.200 --> 03:45.233
- Fine!
- 美好的！

03:45.300 --> 03:46.433
If you insist,
如果你坚持的话

03:46.500 --> 03:48.167
I'll find a non-vaporizing way
我会找到一种不蒸发的方式

03:48.233 --> 03:49.167
to get rid of them.
摆脱他们。

03:49.233 --> 03:51.067
Jeez!
天啊！

03:51.100 --> 03:52.633
- * La la la la *
-*啦啦啦啦*

03:52.700 --> 03:55.333
* La la la la
la la la *
*啦啦啦啦
啦啦啦*

03:55.400 --> 03:58.267
* La la la la la-- *
*啦啦啦啦啦——*

03:58.333 --> 03:59.900
Huh?
啊？

04:00.067 --> 04:02.233
"Free amoeba puppies"?
“免费阿米巴小狗”？

04:02.300 --> 04:03.300
Oh, hey, Plankton.
哦，嘿，浮游生物。

04:03.367 --> 04:04.367
What's with the sign?
标志怎么了？

04:04.433 --> 04:05.967
- I fed Spot too much,
- 我喂 Spot 太多了，

04:06.067 --> 04:07.267
and he had puppies.
他还有小狗。

04:07.333 --> 04:09.833
You want a few thousand?
你想要几千？

04:09.900 --> 04:11.900
They're free
with an order of chum.
他们是免费的
带着密友的命令。

04:11.967 --> 04:13.067
- [gags]
- [笑声]

04:13.133 --> 04:14.133
No thank you, Plankton.
不，谢谢你，浮游生物。

04:14.200 --> 04:15.800
I, uh, already ate.
我，呃，已经吃过了。

04:15.867 --> 04:17.833
But I can help you
get your puppies adopted.
但我可以帮助你
领养你的小狗。

04:17.900 --> 04:19.933
I did get Patrick
into a good home.
我确实得到了帕特里克
进入一个美好的家。

04:20.067 --> 04:21.867
- [sniffing]
- [嗅嗅]

04:21.933 --> 04:24.800
- You sure this is a guard dog,
SpongeBob?
- 你确定这是一只看门狗，
海绵宝宝？

04:24.867 --> 04:28.700
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

04:28.767 --> 04:30.300
- Would you like to purchase --
- 您想购买吗——

04:30.367 --> 04:31.333
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

04:31.400 --> 04:33.133
This is our corner now!
现在这是我们的角落了！

04:33.200 --> 04:35.067
[both crying]
[两人都哭了]

04:35.133 --> 04:38.833
- Now, Plankton, just politely
offer people free puppies,
- 现在，浮游生物，礼貌一点
为人们提供免费的小狗，

04:38.900 --> 04:41.300
and they'll all be adopted
in no time.
他们都会被收养
很快。

04:41.367 --> 04:42.567
- You there!
- 你在那里！

04:42.633 --> 04:45.400
I demand you take
an amoeba puppy.
我要求你拿
一只阿米巴小狗。

04:47.167 --> 04:49.667
- But that doesn't look
like a puppy to me.
- 但这看起来并不
对我来说就像一只小狗。

04:49.733 --> 04:52.267
More like a speck of dirt.
更像是一粒泥土。

04:52.333 --> 04:55.767
- These are purebred amoebas,
swine!
- 这些是纯种阿米巴原虫，
猪！

04:55.833 --> 04:57.133
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

04:57.200 --> 04:58.767
[zapping]
[电击]

04:58.833 --> 05:00.533
[screaming]
[尖叫]

05:00.600 --> 05:03.133
- Take this puppy,
or I'll destroy you!
- 带上这只小狗，
不然我就毁了你！

05:03.200 --> 05:05.833
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

05:05.900 --> 05:08.900
- Maybe if people could see
how cute these puppies are,
-也许如果人们能看到
这些小狗多可爱啊

05:08.967 --> 05:11.067
they'd be more interested
in taking 'em.
他们会更感兴趣
接受他们。

05:11.133 --> 05:14.467
[murmuring]
[淙淙]

05:14.533 --> 05:15.933
- Wait, what are you doing?
- 等等，你在做什么？

05:16.067 --> 05:18.567
[accordion music]
[手风琴音乐]

05:19.333 --> 05:20.767
Ta-da!
哒哒！

05:20.833 --> 05:22.900
- I can't believe
that actually worked.
- 我不敢相信
这确实有效。

05:22.967 --> 05:26.133
- Say, that's a fine-looking
amoeba.
- 说吧，这身材真好看
阿米巴原虫。

05:26.200 --> 05:27.233
- Thanks! You want him?
- 谢谢！你想要他吗？

05:27.300 --> 05:28.833
He's free to a good home.
他可以自由地去一个好家了。

05:28.900 --> 05:29.833
- Whoo!
- 呼！

05:29.900 --> 05:31.633
- Do you have another amoeba?
- 你还有另一个阿米巴原虫吗？

05:31.700 --> 05:34.167
They are too adorable.
他们太可爱了。

05:34.233 --> 05:37.267
- Smoosh up some more puppies,
SpongeBob.
- 抚平更多的小狗，
海绵宝宝。

05:37.333 --> 05:39.467
We are in business!
我们在做生意！

05:39.533 --> 05:41.800
- I'm smooshin'!
I'm smooshin'!
- 我很开心！
我晕了！

05:41.867 --> 05:44.900
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:46.200 --> 05:48.800
[puppies barking]
all: Aww.
[小狗吠叫]
全体：哇。

05:49.733 --> 05:51.367
- Don't be sad, Matilda.
- 别伤心，玛蒂尔达。

05:51.433 --> 05:53.667
Mommy has to go
to her arraignment,
妈妈得走了
对她的提审，

05:53.733 --> 05:55.800
but she'll be back soon.
但她很快就会回来。

05:55.867 --> 05:57.233
Mwah!
哇！

05:57.300 --> 05:58.700
- [whining]
- [抱怨]

06:00.400 --> 06:01.500
[barking]
[叫声]

06:01.567 --> 06:03.500
[items shattering]
[物品破碎]

06:03.567 --> 06:06.800
[snarling]
[咆哮]

06:08.233 --> 06:13.067
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

06:13.100 --> 06:16.800
[barking]
[叫声]

06:16.867 --> 06:18.833
- Puppy?
You came back?
- 小狗？
你回来了吗？

06:18.900 --> 06:20.667
- [barks]
- [吠叫]

06:21.533 --> 06:23.700
- Did you take this
from your new owner?
- 你拿了这个吗
来自你的新主人？

06:23.767 --> 06:25.067
That is rude, puppy!
这太粗鲁了，小狗！

06:25.133 --> 06:26.233
Very, very rude!
非常非常粗鲁！

06:26.300 --> 06:28.800
[puppies barking]
[小狗吠叫]

06:28.867 --> 06:31.267
- Wait, you all
took something...
- 等等，你们大家
拿了东西...

06:31.333 --> 06:33.333
and brought it back to me?
然后把它带回来给我？

06:33.400 --> 06:36.200
Hmm...
唔...

06:36.267 --> 06:38.667
I don't need any of this junk.
我不需要这些垃圾。

06:40.067 --> 06:41.067
[claps]
[鼓掌]

06:41.067 --> 06:42.600
[puppies retching]
[小狗干呕]

06:42.667 --> 06:44.267
But perhaps
there is something
但或许
有东西

06:44.333 --> 06:46.067
you could get for me,
你可以为我得到，

06:46.067 --> 06:49.433
like the Krabby Patty
secret formula?
就像蟹黄饼一样
秘密配方？

06:49.500 --> 06:52.833
[cackling]
[咯咯笑]

06:52.900 --> 06:54.867
[coughing]
[咳嗽]

06:54.933 --> 06:57.800
Anyone happen to steal
a throat lozenge?
任何人碰巧偷东西
润喉糖？

06:57.867 --> 06:58.633
No? Okay.
不？好的。

06:58.700 --> 06:59.800
Come on, pups!
加油，小狗们！

06:59.867 --> 07:02.200
We've got some training to--
我们接受了一些训练——

07:02.267 --> 07:03.733
[puppies barking]
[小狗吠叫]

07:03.800 --> 07:05.533
Still rebooting, huh?
还是重启吧？

07:05.600 --> 07:07.733
[puppies growling and barking]
[小狗咆哮和吠叫]

07:07.800 --> 07:09.500
- I might need someone
- 我可能需要一个人

07:09.567 --> 07:11.900
to help train
these amoebas.
帮助训练
这些阿米巴原虫。

07:13.633 --> 07:15.133
- I'm glad you called me,
Plankton.
- 我很高兴你打电话给我
浮游生物。

07:15.200 --> 07:19.067
I am the best pet trainer
in all of Bikini Bottom.
我是最好的宠物训练师
在所有比基尼底部。

07:19.100 --> 07:21.100
Why, Patrick
is already housebroken.
为什么，帕特里克
已经是家破人亡了。

07:21.167 --> 07:24.300
- [grumbling] Oh, yeah,
he'll just use the litter box.
- [抱怨]哦，是的，
他只会使用垃圾箱。

07:24.367 --> 07:25.300
Bad Patrick.
- [whimpering]
坏帕特里克。
- [呜咽]

07:25.367 --> 07:26.767
- Bad Patrick Star.
- 坏帕特里克星。

07:26.833 --> 07:28.267
- To train a puppy,
- 训练小狗，

07:28.333 --> 07:30.433
one must think like a puppy.
人必须像小狗一样思考。

07:30.500 --> 07:32.933
[straining]
[紧张]

07:33.067 --> 07:34.567
[barking]
[叫声]

07:35.667 --> 07:37.067
Woof, woof, woof!
汪汪汪！

07:37.067 --> 07:40.633
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

07:40.700 --> 07:42.600
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

07:42.667 --> 07:44.433
Voilà! Eh?
瞧！呃？

07:44.500 --> 07:47.333
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

07:47.400 --> 07:49.133
- [barking]
- [吠叫]

07:49.200 --> 07:50.300
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

07:50.367 --> 07:51.800
- Woof!
- 汪！

07:53.100 --> 07:54.533
Woof, woof, woof!
汪汪汪！

07:54.600 --> 07:56.633
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

07:56.700 --> 07:57.633
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

07:57.700 --> 07:59.733
- [barking]
- [吠叫]

07:59.800 --> 08:01.067
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

08:01.067 --> 08:03.300
[explosion]
[爆炸]

08:04.233 --> 08:05.667
Well, SpongeBob,
嗯，海绵宝宝，

08:05.733 --> 08:08.467
after several grueling hours
of training,
经过几个小时的艰苦努力
的培训，

08:08.533 --> 08:09.933
the puppies are ready.
小狗们准备好了。

08:10.067 --> 08:11.633
Allow me to introduce them.
请允许我介绍一下他们。

08:11.700 --> 08:12.800
[buzzer blares]
[蜂鸣器鸣响]

08:12.867 --> 08:14.867
There's Demolitions Puppy.
有拆毁小狗。

08:16.967 --> 08:18.967
[muffled explosion]
[低沉的爆炸声]

08:19.067 --> 08:20.300
Acrobat Puppy.
杂技演员小狗。

08:20.367 --> 08:21.800
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

08:21.867 --> 08:24.500
- Identical Twin Puppies.
- 同卵双胞胎小狗。

08:24.567 --> 08:28.467
And of course,
Comic Relief Puppy.
当然，
漫画救济小狗。

08:28.533 --> 08:29.667
- Hey, is this another plan
- 嘿，这是另一个计划吗

08:29.733 --> 08:31.233
to steal the secret formula?
窃取秘密配方？

08:31.300 --> 08:32.867
- Of course it is,
- 当然是，

08:32.933 --> 08:36.100
and there's nothing
you can do about it!
什么也没有
你可以做的！

08:36.167 --> 08:37.367
[laughs]
[笑]

08:37.433 --> 08:38.733
[alarm blares]
- Huh? Whoa!
[警报声]
- 啊？哇！

08:38.800 --> 08:40.833
[screaming]
[尖叫]

08:42.133 --> 08:44.200
You'll never get away
with this, Plankton!
你永远无法逃脱
有了这个，浮游生物！

08:44.267 --> 08:46.833
- Oh, but I will get away
with this, Plankton!
- 哦，但我会离开
有了这个，浮游生物！

08:46.900 --> 08:48.233
I mean, SpongeBob.
我是说，海绵宝宝。

08:48.300 --> 08:50.700
Allow me to explain.
请允许我解释一下。

08:50.767 --> 08:52.500
First, we'll need
a distraction
首先，我们需要
分散注意力

08:52.567 --> 08:54.133
inside the Krusty Krab.
蟹堡王里面。

08:54.200 --> 08:56.433
That's where
the Identical Twin Puppies
那就是那里
同卵双胞胎小狗

08:56.500 --> 08:57.733
come into play.
发挥作用。

08:57.800 --> 09:01.233
- Aww, I want one.
It's so--
- 哇，我想要一个。
是这样的——

09:01.300 --> 09:04.333
[all exclaiming]
[所有人惊呼]

09:04.400 --> 09:06.767
- Free from Krabs'
watchful eye,
- 不含蟹肉
警惕的眼睛，

09:06.833 --> 09:09.967
Acrobat Puppy can begin
his infiltration.
Acrobat Puppy 可以开始了
他的渗透。

09:10.067 --> 09:13.167
[smooth instrumental music]
【流畅的器乐】

09:13.233 --> 09:19.700
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

09:19.767 --> 09:21.467
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

09:21.533 --> 09:24.533
- Once Acrobat Puppy
gets inside Krabs' office,
- 曾经的杂技演员小狗
进入蟹老板的办公室，

09:24.600 --> 09:27.267
he'll open the window
for Demolitions Puppy.
他会打开窗户
对于拆除小狗。

09:27.333 --> 09:28.700
Then, Demolitions Puppy
然后，拆毁小狗

09:28.767 --> 09:32.167
will blow the safe wide open.
会把保险箱炸开。

09:32.233 --> 09:33.500
[button chimes]
[按钮铃声]

09:33.567 --> 09:35.767
[explosion]
[爆炸]

09:35.833 --> 09:36.867
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

09:36.933 --> 09:38.500
With the safe door open,
当保险柜门打开时，

09:38.567 --> 09:41.500
the formula is mine!
公式是我的！

09:41.567 --> 09:43.400
And finally, just for fun,
最后，只是为了好玩，

09:43.467 --> 09:47.100
Comic Relief Puppy
adds a dollop of humor.
漫画救济小狗
增添了一抹幽默。

09:47.167 --> 09:49.400
- Whoo-hoo!
- 呼呼！

09:49.467 --> 09:50.867
- That's never gonna work.
- 那是永远行不通的。

09:50.933 --> 09:53.800
- [laughs]
But it already has!
- [笑]
但它已经有了！

09:53.867 --> 09:55.800
What do you think
the puppies have been doing
你觉得怎么样
小狗们一直在做

09:55.867 --> 09:56.867
all this time?
一直这样？

09:56.933 --> 09:59.500
Now to open my prize!
现在打开我的奖品！

09:59.567 --> 10:02.800
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

10:06.467 --> 10:08.633
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

10:08.700 --> 10:11.733
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

10:11.800 --> 10:14.167
- Karen! Baby!
- 凯伦！婴儿！

10:14.233 --> 10:15.233
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:15.300 --> 10:17.500
[straining]
[紧张]

10:17.567 --> 10:18.600
- [inhales deeply]
- [深吸一口气]

10:18.667 --> 10:21.067
[whistles]
[口哨声]

10:21.867 --> 10:23.967
Woof, woof, ruff, ruff,
woof, woof!
汪汪，汪汪，颈圈，颈圈，
汪汪！

10:24.700 --> 10:26.600
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:26.667 --> 10:28.700
- [arf, arf]
- [bark, bark]
- [arf，arf]
- [树皮，树皮]

10:28.767 --> 10:30.200
[buzzer]
[蜂鸣器]

10:30.267 --> 10:32.100
- Woof, woof!
- 汪汪汪！

10:32.167 --> 10:34.267
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

10:34.333 --> 10:36.967
- Plankton!
Won't you ever learn?
- 浮游生物！
你永远不会学习吗？

10:37.033 --> 10:38.833
You're never gonna
get the formula!
你永远不会
得到公式！

10:38.900 --> 10:42.067
- Come on, SpongeBob.
Maybe we can work something out!
- 来吧，海绵宝宝。
也许我们可以想办法！

10:42.133 --> 10:45.733
I'll give ya 10%
of my patty profits. Huh?
我给你10%
我的利润。啊？

10:45.800 --> 10:48.767
- Sorry, Plankton.
You leave me no choice.
- 对不起，浮游生物。
你让我别无选择。

10:50.633 --> 10:52.133
- Uh-oh.
- 呃哦。

10:52.200 --> 10:54.200
[all barking]
[全都吠叫]

10:57.067 --> 10:59.167
all: Yip, yip, yip, yip, yip!
全体：耶，耶，耶，耶，耶！

10:59.233 --> 11:03.467
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

11:03.533 --> 11:04.833
- I believe this is yours.
- 我相信这是你的。

11:04.900 --> 11:06.667
- Hey!
Good boy, Patrick!
- 嘿！
好孩子，帕特里克！

11:06.733 --> 11:08.100
You get a treat!
你得到了款待！

11:08.167 --> 11:09.200
- [crunching]
- [嘎吱嘎吱]

11:09.267 --> 11:10.733
[happy grunts]
- Okay. No, wait!
[快乐的咕噜声]
- 好的。不，等等！

11:10.800 --> 11:12.733
I--Get offa me!
What are you--
我——滚开我！
你是做什么的 -

11:12.800 --> 11:15.067
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

11:15.100 --> 11:16.867
[electronic whirring]
[电子呼呼声]

11:16.933 --> 11:18.767
- Reboot...complete.
- 重新启动...完成。

11:18.833 --> 11:20.600
Oh! Oh! Oh ha!
哦！哦！哦哈！

11:20.667 --> 11:23.067
More puppies?
For me?!
更多小狗？
为我？！

11:23.133 --> 11:27.233
Oh, Sheldon,
I couldn't be happier!
哦，谢尔顿，
我高兴极了！

11:27.300 --> 11:29.667
[laughing]
[笑]

11:29.733 --> 11:31.800
[puppies barking, panting]
[小狗吠叫、气喘吁吁]

11:34.667 --> 11:36.367
- Wait, puppy.
- 等等，小狗。

11:36.433 --> 11:38.433
Whoa, puppy!
哇，小狗！

11:38.500 --> 11:40.433
Ooh!
哦！

11:40.500 --> 11:43.367
Cute...overload!
可爱……超载！

11:43.433 --> 11:47.733
Aah!
啊啊！

啊啊！